@DiscordApp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5038

### 1. Register User A
POST {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser4@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "username": "testname3",
  "role": "User"
}

###

### 2. Login User A
# @name login
POST {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser3@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 3. Extract Bearer Token from Login
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..XvpROrWi6oL1hjg_lioEnfZP0o9us_U58yk5oumRXSM

###

### 4. Confirm Authentication Works
GET {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 5. Send Friend Request
POST {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/friend-requests/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "receiverId": "e36fdfc7-de3a-47e2-a490-1da4ab46e1dd"
}

###

### 6. Get Incoming Pending Requests
GET {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/friend-requests/incoming
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 7. Get Outgoing Pending Requests
GET {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/friend-requests/outgoing
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 8. Accept Friend Request (Replace 1 with actual requestId)
POST {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/friend-requests/4/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 9. Decline/Cancel Friend Request (Replace 1 with actual requestId)
DELETE {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/friend-requests/2/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 10. Get Friends List
GET {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 11. Unfriend User (Replace GUID with target user's ID)
DELETE {{DiscordApp_HostAddress}}/api/friends/31809e2c-ecc5-4b87-96de-3e48765d25d4
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###